  "customfield_10087": null,
  "customfield_10121": null,
  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "PUT requests to update metdata for a NonRdfSourceDescription adds triples to the RDF representation instead of replacing them.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce, make a NonRdfSource (I PUT'd a text file)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -i -X PUT -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" --data-binary \"@text.txt\" http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Update its title using the following RDF and command",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "@prefix dcterms:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .\r\n<http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata>\r\n        dcterms:title               \"ORIGINAL\"@en ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl -X PUT -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" -H \"Prefer: return=minimal; handling=lenient\" --data-binary \"@rdf.ttl\" http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you GET the resource you'll see the title,  and if you update it with another PUT, you'll get both in the resulting RDF:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .\r\n<http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata>\r\n        dcterms:title            \"CHANGED\"@en ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl -X PUT -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" -H \"Prefer: return=minimal; handling=lenient\" --data-binary \"@rdf.ttl\" http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ curl localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata\r\n@prefix premis:  <http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#> .\r\n@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\r\n@prefix fedora:  <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#> .\r\n@prefix ebucore:  <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#> .\r\n@prefix ldp:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .\r\n@prefix dcterms:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .\r\n@prefix iana:  <http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/> .<http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text>\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:NonRdfSourceDescription ;\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:Binary ;\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:Resource ;\r\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy    \"bypassAdmin\" ;\r\n        premis:hasSize           \"15\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> ;\r\n        ebucore:hasMimeType      \"text/plain\" ;\r\n        fedora:createdBy         \"bypassAdmin\" ;\r\n        fedora:created           \"2019-06-17T16:18:54.19Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\r\n        fedora:lastModified      \"2019-06-17T16:20:44.624Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\r\n        premis:hasMessageDigest  <urn:sha1:9d8b92c51da294c82d42a0cb35629259b1573f43> ;\r\n        ebucore:filename         \"\" ;\r\n        dcterms:title            \"ORIGINAL\"@en ;\r\n        dcterms:title            \"CHANGED\"@en ;\r\n        rdf:type                 ldp:NonRDFSource ;\r\n        iana:describedby         <http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:metadata> ;\r\n        fedora:hasFixityService  <http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/text/fcr:fixity> .",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
